 # A Partitioned Hydromechanical Framework for Four Leg Reusable Launch Vehicle Landing on a Floating Barge
 
+> **Revision status — 26 September 2026.** Full-text scientific and language revision. Sections, equations, all four tables and eight figures are retained. Figure 6 and Table 4 contain explicitly labeled pre-correction results. No new corrected Chrono landing run is claimed. The separate review document identifies the required reruns before submission.
